  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXccZ0mBfNL2gGmhoCJyRjom12R7o0AJq315z8asem9DXgpaw5R8FKHgB99sXVd811Z1E6PWLLlBboIBN6lJLsx1jkgYn88v86UD0cd1EpSGXB0ilHw2qWxH9d4GKW0271lW5YEPbKdoU2XTeZTR5nGWe1mG?key=XtjY3RdaRppu0JbSAQSR_w\" width=\"624\" height=\"109\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">基于电影《关灯以后》……</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>该模组仅在黑暗中移动。最好待在光亮处，因为黑暗中潜藏着极其不祥之物……</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">若你稍有不慎，该实体便会将你撕碎。它起初大多处于被动状态，但一旦它视你为威胁，便为时已晚。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">该实体名为黛安娜（Diana）。她曾是实验失败的受试者。如今，她正以复仇之念纠缠着他人的生活。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\">本模组需要 Geckolib</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/GNiBq1BqkT0?si=6AlcCFuNjZAwqISz\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RX9oRLkS-es?si=yh0GNyR6trnKkRym\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
